{"parse": {"title": "洛基-03", "pageid": 94305, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E5%9F%BA-02\" title=\"洛基-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">洛基-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E5%9F%BA-04\" title=\"洛基-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">洛基</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BB.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"绿\">绿</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 绿</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Green</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一沓白纸在火盆中燃烧着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>这里是个不错的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多松散地坐在轮椅上，眯着眼睛望着远处的湖景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湖面将夕阳反射为无数条光纹，金色的曝点在波澜上荡漾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>我好像来得很晚，阿君，因为我从轮椅挪到驾驶位上费了不少时间。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><br /><span style=\"font-size:138%\"><span style=\"text-align:right\">绿  1982</span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>怎么，你挪了好几个月？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>充满厌恶的声音从身后传来，菲林士多无奈地闭上了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-630712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>呵，看起来你还挺精神的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有了何日君从中调节，本就两看生厌的二人一见面便充满了火药味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奇星越过了菲林士多，走到何日君的墓前，恭敬地将手中的花束放在了墓碑的前面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>许久不见，没想到你竟然这么恨我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这句话，奇星愤地扭过头来，眼神如箭般死死地盯着菲林士多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>你没想到？阿君下葬那天你是被什么天大的事拖住了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多任由奇星释放着情绪，宛如一桩沉静的沙袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对这个话题做出回应不如另起一个新的话题，一个能让她平复一下心情的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>她墓前的花，都是你放的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>又与你何干？你不配来这里假惺惺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>那你呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奇星的眼神中现出一丝恍惚，她转过身去，背对着菲林士多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>我是来这里赎罪的……我该换一种更加平和的方式处理C07的结局……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奇星蹲了下去，将头轻轻地靠在冰冷的墓碑上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>《三燕归巢》……我该早些告诉她……我很喜欢这个故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>但现在什么都来不及了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多驱使木偶控制轮椅上前，将温暖的掌心轻轻地盖上了奇星的肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>这不怪你。我们已经替她挡下很多了，如果让泰瑞莎直面外部对C07的期许，按照她的性格，只会更加消耗自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你该知道投资者们心目中的理想获利会多么的不切实际……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听着菲林士多的话，奇星紧紧地攥紧了拳，发白的掌指关节因为愤怒而颤抖着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>那就该用阿君的命来换吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声怒吼过后，奇星似乎终于意识到了肩上的手来自菲林士多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她用力地推开了菲林士多的手，起身拉开了自己与她的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>阿君不该是这种结局，C07也不该！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>C07绝不会向那些人低头……那个结局只是你们一厢情愿的美梦罢了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奇星低头看着何日君那张黑色墓碑上贴着的照片，手指不禁触碰了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>是阿君让我看到了另一种生活的可能，如果没有她，我现在还像只老鼠……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>错的不是阿君，错的是你们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-630701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奇星：</div><div>……我要退出“新艺术”公司！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不等菲林士多的回应，奇星便转身离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在墓碑间的小道中疾步远去，一路上的矮灌木都在轻轻摇晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>收回了自己的视线，菲林士多疲乏地用手支着前额。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>我是该早点来这里……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两个月前，《迷影谍》拍摄期间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>回想起投资商对影片的评价，菲林士多狠狠地敲了一下方向盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>又是市场接不接受的问题……这才该是主角最精彩的情感爆发！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>情感，又是情感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多将车停在了路边，繁华路段上，时不时有车从菲林士多身边呼啸而过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再停留一段时间，就会有骑摩托车的阿sir上来贴罚单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但对于将近半个月每天都只睡四五个小时的菲林士多来说，已经没有什么事能比眼前新电影《迷影谍》的剧情问题更严重的了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>我该怎么办呢，泰瑞莎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>泰瑞莎……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>名字脱口而出的时候，菲林士多又对何日君逝世的理解更深了一层。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当何日君逝世的消息传到菲林士多的耳中时，她正耽于新电影的筹拍当中，在短暂的震惊后，她如逃避般将注意力全部灌注到了新电影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再次听到消息的时候，便已经是何日君葬礼过后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当时的菲林士多正与剧组人员重复着对主角高光戏份的修改，阿琳似乎在她的行程表上写出了何日君葬礼的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>但这又有什么意义呢，一场葬礼……又不能让泰瑞莎复活，她也不可能再听到你们任何人的一句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-630811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-630811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-630811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>难道真会有灵魂这一说？泰瑞莎！你在吗？泰瑞莎？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不可能获得任何回应，菲林士多无奈地笑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-630810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-630810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-630810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>呵呵……我在干什么呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手习惯性地摸向手套箱，但里面只有一个空空的烟盒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多厌恶地将烟盒扔向了车外，但过了一会，她又冲了出去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/61/Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多急急地将烟盒捡了起来，把空烟盒里那张皱皱的金锡纸卷成了一条，叼在了嘴里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那可望不可即的烟草味道却让她更烦躁了，她狠狠地踢了车门一脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一本不知何时放在车里的剧本从后座上滑落了下来，菲林士多将剧本捧在了手里面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>《迷影谍》，顺应了电影市场的产物，题材新颖、大腕云集，但菲林士多总觉得这是一本不合格的剧本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以往，每当拿到新剧本时，她总是会先和泰瑞莎各自将剧本研读一遍，随后再聚在一起讨论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但现在，剧本上只剩下了自己的笔迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剧本敲定时，何日君早已与她分道扬镳，再听到的便是她撒手人寰的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>何……日……君……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在相识的最开始，菲林士多只听过她“泰瑞莎”这个名字，当时菲林士多只看到了一个土气又清秀的背影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到那个背影说到自己来自香港时，菲林士多才意识到她与自己来自同一个地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此后自己便一直称呼她为泰瑞莎，“何日君”这个名字是何时流入她的耳朵的，菲林士多已经没有印象了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但此时，泰瑞莎似乎只是“何日君”了，那是她墓碑上的名字，留在这里的只有“何日君”，泰瑞莎已经真正地死去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\">再帮帮我吧……阿君……</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_xianggangjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多心中涌起一股冲动，即使她知道泰瑞莎已经死去，知道自己的行为已经毫无意义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>就像从前，在我家的工作室里那样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>发动机被启动，整辆车都颤抖了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-630814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>去泰瑞莎的墓地那边，帮我找地址，阿琳应该标记在我的行程表里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闻声，木偶们行动了起来，它们马上将地点翻找了出来，展示于菲林士多的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-630812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-630812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a4/HeadIconSmall-630812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挂挡，油门，引擎发出刺耳的轰响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多驶出烟尘，很快消失在夜色油柏路的尽头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hubian_huanghun\"><img alt=\"hubian_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-hubian_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-hubian_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>但结果就是，因为过度疲劳和亢奋，我将红灯看成了绿灯，然后……砰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵微风吹来，将火盆中的白纸吹翻了个面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白纸的另一面印着残缺的“谍”字，没烧尽的纸面上只有菲林士多的字迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>现在，我终于来到这里了，阿君。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你是一个老好人，总是会尽量满足周围人对你的期许，然后带着一脸“不必在乎我”的笑意站在人群的最后，使得人们忘记你有多重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你死去了，这件事我现在才彻底理解，但我该如何消解呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火盆中的火缓慢地吞噬了白色的纸，黑色的残骸与灰色的余烬中裹挟着一线红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8f/HeadIconSmall-311101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>最后一次，再教教我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火星被热气推举向上，越过浓郁的绿色和波光粼粼的暖橙，消失在了视野之外。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "洛基-03"}}